/*
 * faucet-unit-note.compact — no circuit; funding unit pointer only.
 * Official docs (https://docs.midnight.network/guides/acquire-tokens) say a Preprod faucet
 * request sends 1,000 tNIGHT and the hosted page confirms "You will shortly receive 1000 tNight".
 * Upstream servicedesk#254 reports that POST /drips multiplies the requested amount by 5 tNIGHT
 * (TNIGHT_UNIT = 5_000_000n STAR). A body with "amount": "1000" registers 5,000 tNIGHT and the
 * page confirms 5000. Compact has no faucet API. This file only pins the known mismatch for
 * builders who fund before calling circuits. LOCAL-TRUE. No on-chain deploy is claimed.
 *
 * Upstream: https://github.com/midnightntwrk/servicedesk/issues/254
 * Pins: Compact ~0.31.1 / language ~0.23, midnight-js 4.1.1, DApp Connector 4.0.1, proof-server 8.1.0.
 *
 * Built by @kshot9000 https://x.com/kshot9000
 * Email: kshot9000@gmail.com
 * Cardano donation: addr1q8hnl6vl5a6k3rw3n5g3jtte696zcl76kfatzv7gpswa9r0dj7fma6klq55y4ffm7tf0em09udnyhuk4ah92pl5x9jpqjae44v
 * Teams: @midnightntwrk @MidnightNtwrk @midnightfdn @Cardano @InputOutputHK @cardano-foundation
 */

pragma language_version >= 0.22 && <= 0.23;

import CompactStandardLibrary;

// No exported circuit. Faucet unit classification is off-chain.
// See docs/FAUCET-PAGE-CONFIRMATION-MISMATCH.md and
